[<<cite:GoR>> Lemma 7.4]
Suppose that $\Tab(w')\prec_{g} \Tab(w)$ with $g\in\mathfrak{gl}(n)$ of the form $E_{k,k+1}$ or $E_{k+1,k}$, then $|\Omega^{+}(\Tab(w'))|\geq |\Omega^{+}(\Tab(w))|-1$. Moreover, the complete list of Gelfand-Tsetlin tableaux $\Tab(w)$ and $\Tab(w')$ such that $\Tab(w')\prec_{g} \Tab(w)$ and $|\Omega^{+}(\Tab(w'))|= |\Omega^{+}(\Tab(w))|-1$ is as follows.

- [(i)]
\begin{center}
\Stone{$a$}\Stone{$b$}\Stone{$c$} \Stone{$a$}\Stone{$b$}\Stone{$c$}
[0.2pt]
$\Tab(w)$= \Stone{$x$}\Stone{$x-t$} $\Tab(w')$= \Stone{$x-t$}\Stone{$x$}
[0.2pt]
\Stone{$x$} \Stone{$x+1$}

\end{center}
for $t\in\mathbb{Z}_{>0}$.

- [(ii)]
\begin{center}
\Stone{$a$}\Stone{$b$}\Stone{$c$} \Stone{$a$}\Stone{$b$}\Stone{$c$}
[0.2pt]
$\Tab(w)$= \Stone{$x$}\Stone{$x-t$} $\Tab(w')$= \Stone{$x-t$}\Stone{$x-1$}
[0.2pt]
\Stone{$x$} \Stone{$x$}

\end{center}
for $t\in\mathbb{Z}_{>0}$.

- [(iii)]
\begin{center}
\Stone{$a$}\Stone{$b$}\Stone{$c$} \Stone{$a$}\Stone{$b$}\Stone{$c$}
[0.2pt]
$\Tab(w)$= \Stone{$x$}\Stone{$x$} $\Tab(w')$= \Stone{$x-1$}\Stone{$x$}
[0.2pt]
\Stone{$x$} \Stone{$x$}.

\end{center}

- [(iv)] \begin{center}
\Stone{$x$}\Stone{$b$}\Stone{$c$} \Stone{$x$}\Stone{$b$}\Stone{$c$}
[0.2pt]
$\Tab(w)$= \Stone{$x$}\Stone{$x-t$} $\Tab(w')$= \Stone{$x-t$}\Stone{$x+1$}
[0.2pt]
\Stone{$z$} \Stone{$z$}

\end{center}
for $t\in\mathbb{Z}_{>0}$, $b\neq x$, and $c\neq x$.

- [(v)]
\begin{center}
\Stone{$x$}\Stone{$b$}\Stone{$c$} \Stone{$x$}\Stone{$b$}\Stone{$c$}
[0.2pt]
$\Tab(w)$= \Stone{$x$}\Stone{$x$} $\Tab(w')$= \Stone{$x$}\Stone{$x+1$}
[0.2pt]
\Stone{$z$} \Stone{$z$}

\end{center}
for $b\neq x$ and $c\neq x$.
